 We krijgen dan 
\begin_inset Formula $k=\sqrt{k_{h}k_{v}}=\sqrt{9\times1}=3$
\end_inset

 m/d.
 Dus 
\begin_inset Formula $d\hat{x}=\sqrt{\frac{3}{9}}dx=\frac{1}{3}dx$
\end_inset

 en 
\begin_inset Formula $d\hat{z}=\sqrt{\frac{9}{1}}dz=3dz$
\end_inset

.
